#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:105
msgid "3.1 IndexSparse Attention"
msgstr "3.1 IndexSparse Attention"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:107
msgid ""
"Fixing `TopK = 4096`, we scale context length from `96K` (`CP = 8`) to "
"`384K` (`CP = 32`) under distributed long-context training shapes. For "
"the forward pass, we report both standalone kernel throughput "
"`IndexSparse (attn)` and end-to-end throughput `IndexSparse (e2e)` with "
"`cutedsl_topk_stream` included."
msgstr ""
"固定 `TopK = 4096`，在分布式长上下文训练的单卡形状下将序列长度从 `96K`（`CP = 8`）扩展到 `384K`（`CP = 32`）。前向同时给出纯注意力算子吞吐 `IndexSparse (attn)`，以及计入 `cutedsl_topk_stream` 选择耗时后的端到端吞吐 `IndexSparse (e2e)`。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:109
msgid "IndexSparse Attention Forward Throughput on NVIDIA B300"
msgstr "NVIDIA B300 上 IndexSparse Attention 的前向吞吐"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:115
msgid "(a) Forward Pass"
msgstr "(a) 前向吞吐"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:118
msgid "IndexSparse Attention Backward Throughput on NVIDIA B300"
msgstr "NVIDIA B300 上 IndexSparse Attention 的反向吞吐"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:124
msgid "(b) Backward Pass"
msgstr "(b) 反向吞吐"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:126
msgid ""
"Benchmarking `IndexSparse Attention` against full-attention `Dense FFA` "
"on NVIDIA B300 across `96K–384K` context lengths (`TopK = 4096`)."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA B300 上 `IndexSparse Attention` 与全量 `Dense FFA` 在 `96K–384K` 上下文长度下的吞吐对比（`TopK = 4096`）。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:129
msgid ""
"Despite scattered token-level gathers, `IndexSparse` sustains `872–1,074 "
"TFLOPs/s` in the forward pass (`Dense FFA` reaches about `1,545 "
"TFLOPs/s`) and `599–713 TFLOPs/s` in the backward pass (`Dense FFA` "
"reaches about `1,280 TFLOPs/s`). In wall-clock time, as context length "
"grows from `96K` to `384K`, end-to-end forward speedup with "
"`cutedsl_topk_stream` included increases from `12.3x` to `32.0x` (`3.19 "
"ms` vs. `102.11 ms`), while backward speedup increases from `13.4x` to "
"`44.7x` (`6.88 ms` vs. `307.88 ms`). Raising `TopK` to `10,240` at `384K`"
" pushes forward kernel throughput to `961 TFLOPs/s` while maintaining "
"`17.5x` end-to-end forward and `16.1x` backward speedups over `Dense "
"FFA`."
msgstr ""
"在离散的单 token 收集下，`IndexSparse` 前向算子仍能达到 `872–1,074 TFLOPs/s`（`Dense FFA` 约为 `1,545 TFLOPs/s`），反向算子达到 `599–713 TFLOPs/s`（`Dense FFA` 约为 `1,280 TFLOPs/s`）。换算为实际运行时间，随着上下文从 `96K` 增长到 `384K`，包含 `cutedsl_topk_stream` 在内的前向端到端加速比从 `12.3x` 持续提升至 `32.0x`（`3.19 ms` 对比 `102.11 ms`），反向加速比从 `13.4x` 提升至 `44.7x`（`6.88 ms` 对比 `307.88 ms`）。在 `384K` 上下文下将 `TopK` 扩大到 `10,240` 时，前向算子吞吐进一步升至 `961 TFLOPs/s`，端到端前向与反向仍分别比全量 `Dense FFA` 快 `17.5x` 与 `16.1x`。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:131
msgid "3.2 Streaming Top-K"
msgstr "3.2 流式 Top-K"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:133
msgid ""
"We benchmark `cutedsl_topk_stream` against `torch.topk` at `k = 10,240` "
"(`10K`) on `4,096` `BF16` rows across row lengths from `64K` to `1M`:"
msgstr ""
"我们在 `k = 10,240`（`10K`）、`4,096` 行 `BF16` 输入下，将 `cutedsl_topk_stream` 与 `torch.topk` 在 `64K` 到 `1M` 的行长范围内直接对比："

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:135
msgid ""
"Streaming Top-K Effective Bandwidth vs torch.topk at k=10240 on NVIDIA "
"B300"
msgstr "NVIDIA B300 上 k=10240 时流式 Top-K 与 torch.topk 的有效访存带宽对比"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:141
msgid ""
"Effective memory bandwidth of `cutedsl_topk_stream` versus `torch.topk` "
"on NVIDIA B300 (`k = 10,240`)."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA B300 上 `cutedsl_topk_stream` 与 `torch.topk` 在 `k = 10,240` 下的有效访存带宽对比。"

#: ../../source/blog/sparse_attn.md:144
msgid ""
"As row length grows from `64K` to `1M`, `torch.topk` stays around "
"`244–408 GB/s` of effective bandwidth. Streaming HBM in a single pass "
"lets `cutedsl_topk_stream` scale up to `4.19 TB/s` at `1M` (`2.09 ms` vs."
" `36.64 ms` for `torch.topk`), delivering `4.8x–17.5x` speedups across "
"`64K–1M`."
msgstr ""
"随着行长从 `64K` 增长到 `1M`，`torch.topk` 的有效带宽维持在 `244–408 GB/s`。`cutedsl_topk_stream` 通过单遍流式读取 HBM，有效带宽随行长持续上升，在 `1M` 长度下达到 `4.19 TB/s`（耗时 `2.09 ms`，`torch.topk` 为 `36.64 ms`），在 `64K–1M` 范围内相对 `torch.topk` 实现 `4.8x–17.5x` 加速。"

